Description: Doubao Say voice input for Linux desktops
 Tap or hold a configurable trigger, speak, and paste recognised text
 into the focused input field. Backed by Doubao's streaming ASR.
 .
 This package installs the Python application, a systemd --user service
 for auto-start. The postinst hook adds the installing user to the 'input'
 group so /dev/input/event* and /dev/uinput are reachable without sudo.
 Python dependencies are installed from the distribution repository.
